[{"title":"拟铜雀伎","author":"汪广洋","text":"燕赵女如玉，轻盈掌上身。\n翠眉长不扫，怅望西陵人。\n酒阑歌舞罢，台榭坐生尘。\n怨入漳河水，悠悠秋复春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"班枝花曲","author":"汪广洋","text":"班枝花，光韡晔，照耀交州二三月。\n交州人家花满城，满城花开未抽叶。\n焜煌隔水散云彩，羃䍥缘空张锦缬。\n信非韩郎丹染根，恐是杜宇啼成血。\n啼成血，著树枝，点缀秾芳也自奇。\n岭南到处足种此，岭北居人稀见之。\n秾芳晓落花时雨，东家西家具鸡黍。\n当门笑拾玛瑙钟，持向城南踏春去。\n交州地暖春归早，一夕东风为谁老。\n翠苞半拆渐吐绵，雪花填满行人道。\n越娃携筐争采绵，采绵盈筐胜万钱。\n搓就琼簪腻如茧，丝成冰缕细如烟。\n细如烟，千万缕，绵绵到㡳知几许。\n的的灯煤夜结花，轧轧机声暗相语。\n停梭掩袂那得眠，吉贝相将下机杼。\n并刀裁剪秋江云，与郎为衣白且新。\n乡社年丰载春酒，郎试新衣赛海神。\n从今只种班枝树，开花结子两成趣。\n劝郎切莫种垂杨，引惹长条系愁绪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄孔博士","author":"汪广洋","text":"畴昔同趋召，鸡鸣候启扉。\n联章门下进，并马月中归。\n掖树啼乌早，风花委路微。\n相望隔千里，目断楚云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄西掖诸友","author":"汪广洋","text":"玉箫吹凤凰，关月写沧浪。\n故国几时到，高楼今夜长。\n候虫啼露壁，凉叶下银床。\n无限怀人意，裁诗远寄将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忠勤楼诸老夜直余时守省作诗寄之 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"西掖延秋爽，高楼倚太清。\n玉绳当坐转，银汉近人明。\n上相思经济，诸公任老成。\n不知前席夜，曾语及苍生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16009,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忠勤楼诸老夜直余时守省作诗寄之 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"耿耿众星白，漫漫长夜寒。\n万方犹事武，一榻岂容安。\n零露沾琴席，高梧下井阑。\n永怀何以托，诗罢动猗兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16010,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和主敬陶员外诗韵","author":"汪广洋","text":"相国深图治，郎官早见亲。\n每膺前席夜，曾属后车尘。\n种竹思仪凤，将书究获麟。\n忧时生白发，迥比向来新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16011,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雪大作子敬寘酒喜朱伯徽寻鲁志敏回 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"冻雪迷山屐，寒风袭毳袍。\n干戈犹未弭，吾辈岂辞劳。\n大字传飞檄，深杯送浊醪。\n老怀殊自喜，早晚问包茅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16012,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜同诸友酌","author":"汪广洋","text":"休拨紫檀槽，且倾黄浊醪。\n凉天兼得月，我辈复持螯。\n彭蠡一杯大，匡庐半壁高。\n竹林潇洒地，应有醉山涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送院判俞子茂进兵番阳","author":"汪广洋","text":"江东风日晴，把酒送君行。\n好慰三千士，将收七十城。\n烟花催叠鼓，云骑拥连营。\n山越人争喜，殊方自此清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"汪广洋","text":"长剑客千里，一杯歌七哀。\n晚节忽已至，秋芳殊未开。\n平沙谁戏马，落日自登台。\n西北天垂远，沧江闻雁来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"露坐","author":"汪广洋","text":"愁极觉宵永，坐深知露凉。\n遣时聊命酒，爱月屡移床。\n北斗回杓近，高城下漏长。\n愧非疏附者，抚事即苍茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南道中","author":"汪广洋","text":"过尽梅关路，滩行喜顺流。\n潖江元到海，横石不容辀。\n岭树垂红果，汀沙聚白鸥。\n从来交广地，还是古扬州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望嘉祥山","author":"汪广洋","text":"放溜数百里，悠然才见山。\n凉风吹雨过，好鸟背人还。\n河水翻银浪，冈峦拥翠鬟。\n不知幽谷底，能得几家閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚晴江上","author":"汪广洋","text":"江水鸭头绿，楚山螺髻青。\n鹧鸪啼不尽，花发树冥冥。\n微风汎兰桨，落日过松亭。\n胜境思弥惬，渔歌随处听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈佥事","author":"汪广洋","text":"露白团秋草，天凉悲晚蛩。\n怀人当永夜，看月上疏桐。\n边候烽传息，畬田岁喜丰。\n了知巡历罢，双旆引归骢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜登豫章南楼","author":"汪广洋","text":"酷热不可敌，起登江上楼。\n焚香就华月，援琴弹素秋。\n高梧宿鸟下，芳蕙夕萤流。\n览物感时序，清笳发暝愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄崔元初","author":"汪广洋","text":"晴轩种竹罢，好月到窗时。\n坐我长松下，歌君流水诗。\n墓田归野雀，疏雨落山葵。\n偶值南来使，殷勤寄所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别刘希敬","author":"汪广洋","text":"与君同理扬州棹，卧看长天入翠微。\n何事杜陵伤远别，不如范蠡赋东归。\n春风小店梨花发，宿雨疏林燕子飞。\n惆怅临溪一杯酒，銮江江上日晖晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵怀旧","author":"汪广洋","text":"官柳阴阴锁汴桥，暖催晴绿上兰桡。\n花吟后土依然在，人去东风不可招。\n紫陌渐稀春试马，青楼殊绝夜鸣箫。\n回看烽火连云起，应使江淹笑寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过胥江寄郑久诚参政","author":"汪广洋","text":"浦口潮来稳系船，汀花如雪草如烟。\n几家茅屋临江水，一路松风响杜鹃。\n帘卷轻寒中酒日，香焚新霁熟梅天。\n少陵心事谁人识，头白相知有郑虔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赣上","author":"汪广洋","text":"两江流出万山溪，云雾蒸蒸动鼓鼙。\n沙暖迥回鸿雁到，草青偏有鹧鸪啼。\n霜馀榕叶凋何晚，雪里梅花绽已齐。\n物候固殊声教远，会询蛮獠及雕题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孙炎","author":"汪广洋","text":"建业孙公子，文如李谪仙。\n江头看明月，醉枕酒瓶眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴城山","author":"汪广洋","text":"夜过吴城下，不眠閒倚窗。\n溯流双橹健，摇月下西江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"汪广洋","text":"昔从江上去，今从江上还。\n家僮笑相语，又过小孤山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16029,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"花底住鸣鞭，晓行滩上船。\n上流风较稳，百丈不须牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"上峡滩水急，下峡滩水平。\n邻船夜相语，两日到严陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"闻道沙溪酒，春来如蜜香。\n买将千百斛，取醉到东阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其四","author":"汪广洋","text":"滩上水平沙，梭舟荡落花。\n吴侬不相识，对面浣春纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩行五首 其五","author":"汪广洋","text":"三百六十滩，相逢相见湾。\n舟师怜远客，数问几时还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16034,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登蒋山望江亭次韵二首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"绝顶出华构，有时来一登。\n曾将六朝事，闲问百年僧。\n寓目诚多感，投身愧未能。\n暂留林下夕，江浦散渔灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16035,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉敕题虎顾彪图","author":"解缙","text":"虎为百兽尊，谁敢触其怒。\n惟有父子情，一步一回顾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16036,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夕景","author":"汪广洋","text":"水树和烟生，人家傍沙语。\n孤帆何处来，惊凫去如雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16037,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过丛山关观孙炎题壁","author":"汪广洋","text":"空翠深深啼竹鸡，丛山塞口日沈西。\n数行大字光如漆，知是孙炎醉后题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16038,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪口渡捕鱼者","author":"汪广洋","text":"芳草渡头歌《竹枝》，晴天小艇放鸬鹚。\n比邻为报春醪熟，自起持鱼贯柳丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16039,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临溪桥 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"石磴盘盘卧湿云，山深瑶草不知春。\n马头忽见梅如雪，纵有轻寒不著人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋徽宗双鸳图","author":"汪广洋","text":"芦叶青青水满塘，文鸳晴卧落花香。\n不因羌管惊飞起，三十六宫春梦长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"毗陵道中二首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"冻合官桥雪作沙，落残枫叶见梅花。\n短篱破宅临流水，狼藉毗陵卖酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"渚矶口阔浪如山，官船客船前后湾。\n明日天晴大家喜，看我鼓枻中流还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其五","author":"汪广洋","text":"大姑庙前花草香，女儿港口江水长。\n江水江花思无限，目断鞋山又夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其七","author":"汪广洋","text":"英英白云多在山，愧我几曾如此閒。\n赣江东下数千里，祇许拿舟十日还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其八","author":"汪广洋","text":"蛾眉今日为君开，一色青天绝点埃。\n浩想往年经济事，赤龙风雨过江来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"大山小山松树齐，千声万声子规啼。\n揽衣起舞夕露下，三更月落吴城西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其四","author":"汪广洋","text":"象牙滩上百花开，参差时复见楼台。\n翠香芹菜缘沙出，雪色鲥鱼上水来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写兴","author":"汪广洋","text":"谢豹花开满岭红，空濛晓雨湿春丛。\n看山不尽行人意，处处东风啼郭公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"归路贪行不觉多，馆夫连日棹江波。\n满船争唱湖州调，两岸云山侧枕过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"小姑南岸对彭郎，天劈云厓峙两傍。\n日暮惊涛没沙尾，江流较比去年强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其四","author":"汪广洋","text":"吉阳洑里采鱼舟，采得鲜鱼为日谋。\n偶见官船忽撑去，却如凫鸭不回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其五","author":"汪广洋","text":"顺风全不费䉡牵，把柁沿江稳放船。\n指点大龙山色近，皖城只在水云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上十首 其七","author":"汪广洋","text":"棹歌齐发浪声喧，池口东边又换船。\n秫酒发醅偏醉客，鲥鱼出网不论钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱伯徽自溪南携酒至婺源山中兼示垂丝海棠醉中求赋七言 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"一自朝云委路岐，春风吹梦托游丝。\n内家丛里分明见，彷佛盘旋立舞时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱伯徽自溪南携酒至婺源山中兼示垂丝海棠醉中求赋七言 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"东家蝴蝶爱悠扬，不肯轻飞过短墙。\n剩买麝煤千百斛，暖薰浓抹到沉香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱伯徽自溪南携酒至婺源山中兼示垂丝海棠醉中求赋七言 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"舞罢霓裳不奈娇，口脂微动酒初潮。\n玉阑西畔春如海，拟倩东风整翠翘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊杨子桥","author":"汪广洋","text":"杨子桥头夜泊船，水波才定月初圆。\n不眠细数经行日，笑隔东风又一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"使关中经过鸿沟","author":"汪广洋","text":"一双秋水佩吴钩，百二山河属壮游。\n往事消沈遗迹在，断鞭斜日过鸿沟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝鸡县","author":"汪广洋","text":"渭河霜满水如苔，一县人家半草莱。\n唯有秋风酸枣木，淡烟深锁斗鸡台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登胥江驿亭","author":"汪广洋","text":"小阁开帘望远岑，暖风晴日啭幽禽。\n胥江流水清无底，较比春愁一样深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"一剑南来两鬓星，肩舆随处看丹青。\n那知庾岭梅边客，却上交州海角亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其二","author":"汪广洋","text":"岛屿潮来日欲曛，聱牙蛮蜑动成群。\n拿舟尽入沙湾泊，为避犁头海上云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其三","author":"汪广洋","text":"海滨朝夕易炎凉，湿气蒸人沁薄裳。\n昨日崖州有船到，满城争买白槟榔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其四","author":"汪广洋","text":"石鼎微熏茉莉香，椰瓢满贮荔枝浆。\n木绵花落南风起，五月交州海气凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其五","author":"汪广洋","text":"牂牁流水碧潺潺，潮落潮生草木閒。\n一片海云吹不起，越人遥指是崖山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其七","author":"汪广洋","text":"雁翅城东涌怒涛，外洋水长蜑船高。\n莫言昨夜南风急，今日登盘有海蚝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其八","author":"汪广洋","text":"吉贝衣单木屐轻，晚凉门外蹋新晴。\n相逢故旧无多语，解说边垆骨董羹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其十","author":"汪广洋","text":"倔强冯陵距海垠，半为鱼鳖半为尘。\n只今编户闻声教，遗类何由辨马人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其十二","author":"汪广洋","text":"谁跨鲸鲵斩断虹，海波飞立瘴云空。\n阇婆真蜡船收澳，知是来朝起飓风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其十五","author":"汪广洋","text":"番禺南望渺烟波，怪底鱼龙出没多。\n顷刻风霆飞白昼，黑龙拖雨过牂牁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其二十三","author":"汪广洋","text":"榕树阴阴集暮鸦，竹深人静似仙家。\n芭蕉小苑垂双实，茉莉南州压万花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南杂录三十首 其三十","author":"汪广洋","text":"蛮落人家厌食鱼，儿孙生长不知书。\n桄榔满种缘山逻，翡翠新收越海墟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清远峡","author":"汪广洋","text":"山酒吹香绿满瓢，转回随峡放兰桡。\n年来不奈愁成绪，都与春风付柳条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凉州曲","author":"汪广洋","text":"琵琶初调古《凉州》，万壑风泉指下流。\n好是开元无事日，玉宸宫里按新秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淳安棹歌二首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"淳安县前江水平，越女唱歌兰叶青。\n山禽只管唤春雨，不道愁人不愿听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过浦江县","author":"汪广洋","text":"官树冥冥啼早鸦，雨晴山县蹋春沙。\n谁家故宅无烟火，一叶松扉锁落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东吴棹歌四首 其一","author":"汪广洋","text":"太湖茫茫水拍天，吴侬只惯夜行船。\n《竹枝》歌罢灯将灭，风雨潇潇人未眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":16078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]